succLaneNo [SimTalk] - lane A or B
Returns the number of the succeeding lane of the specified lane of the TwoLaneTrack designated by
<Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.A.succLaneNo([LaneNumber:integer]) → integer
<Path>.B.succLaneNo([LaneNumber:integer]) → integer
Parameter
The optional parameter LaneNumber of data type integer designates the number of the lane of the n-th
successor lane of the TwoLaneTrack. The objects have to be connected for this to work.
Return Value
The return value has the data type integer.
Example
if MyTwoLaneTrack.A.succLaneNo = 1 
   print "succeeding lane is lane A"
end
SimTalk
